�[�]I just don�[�]t care if I sell records ---- I must not care,because I do the things the way I do,” Taylor said recently by[phone]. He explained that he views each album as a chance to explorea new concept ---- and thus keeps moving into new territory, ratherthan finding something that sells well and then turning out thesame style of record over and over.
